WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Since 1978, China's
economy has grown by over 9

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.550
per cent a year, on average.

3
00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:08.070
At 9 per cent a year,

4
00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:11.620
output per person would
double in about 8 years.

5
00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:15.170
Growth like that helped lift
almost 800 million people

6
00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:17.190
out of extreme poverty.

7
00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:19.180
But where does growth come from?

8
00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:22.890
Can an economy keep growing
just by people spending more?

9
00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:25.340
In this mission, you'll
see two kinds of growth

10
00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:27.330
on one simple curve.

11
00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:29.320
Then you'll use a graph lab:

12
00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:32.970
move two sliders and watch
output and the price level.

13
00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:35.520
Your mission: find out
what it takes to keep

14
00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:37.880
an economy growing year after year.
